      "composition": "multiple-figures",
      "description": "A wide horizontal engraved panel. The bearded Jesse lies asleep at the bottom centre, and from his body a stem rises and branches into curling acanthus scrolls that carry twelve crowned kings in long robes, seated, kneeling or climbing in the loops of the stems; one at the right of centre plays a harp, others hold an orb, a book or flower heads. At the top centre the crowned Virgin sits with the Child on her lap. Dark brown ink line work on cream paper, no frame line, background transparent.",
