      "composition": "single-ornament",
      "description": "A ring-shaped engraved wreath of curling acanthus stems and lobed leaves around an open circular centre. Two thick stems run around the inside of the ring and are bound together at the top and at the bottom. Flower heads, buds, a netted fruit at the lower right and a large blossom at the right sit among the scrolls, which end in small leaf tips around the outer edge. No figures or masks. Dark brown ink line work on cream paper; the centre and the background are transparent.",
