      "description": "An engraved scene of two musicians seated on stone blocks on either side of an octagonal well. At the left a barefoot young man with curly hair in a short tunic plays a lute with a plectrum, facing right; at the right a woman in a long gown with long hair plays a harp, facing left. Between them a small Gothic canopy on four posts with a cross finial and a perched bird rises over the water, a vessel hangs from a tripod above it, a bird drinks at the rim, and two potted trees stand behind. Dark brown ink line work on cream paper, background transparent.",
